     "verification_ref": "英文字母共 26 個，每個有大寫與小寫兩種字形（如 B／b）；基礎事實；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-name-vs-sound", "text": "A letter's name is different from the sound it makes inside a word: the letter 'b' is named /biː/ ('bee'), but it makes the sound /b/ in a word like 'ball'.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "字母名稱音 /biː/（bee）≠ 單字內發音 /b/（ball）；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音條目可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-alpha-order", "text": "The letters follow a fixed order from A to Z; this alphabetical order is how words are arranged in a dictionary.",
