   ],

   "teach": [
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.letter-recognition", "eng.t_base.phonics.letter-writing"],
     "body": "The English alphabet has 26 letters. Each letter has a big (uppercase) form and a small (lowercase) form, like B and b. When you write a letter, keep its shape clear and move from top to bottom.",
     "zh_hint": "英文字母一共有 26 個。每個字母都有「大寫」和「小寫」兩種樣子，像 B 和 b。寫字母時，把形狀寫清楚、通常由上往下寫。"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.letter-recognition"], "audio": "ph_letters_ex1",
     "body": "A a, B b, C c, D d, E e.",
     "zh_hint": "大寫配小寫一起認：A a、B b、C c、D d、E e。"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.name-vs-sound"],
     "body": "Every letter has a name and a sound. The letter 'b' is named /biː/ (we say \"bee\"), but inside a word like 'ball' it makes the short sound /b/. Learn both: the name helps you spell, the sound helps you read.",
     "zh_hint": "每個字母都有「名字」和「音」。字母 b 的名字唸作 /biː/（像在唸「bee」），但在 ball 這種單字裡，它發出的是短短的 /b/ 音。兩個都要記：名字幫你拼字，音幫你讀字。"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.name-vs-sound"], "audio": "ph_letters_ex2",
     "body": "Letter names: A, B, M. Now hear the sounds inside words: ball, map.",
     "zh_hint": "先聽字母的「名字」：A、B、M；再從整個字裡聽它的「音」：ball、map。（名字和音不一樣——名字幫拼字，音幫讀字。）"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.alphabet-order"],
     "body": "The letters always go in the same order, from A to Z. This order is called alphabetical order, and it is how words are listed in a dictionary, so knowing it helps you look words up.",
     "zh_hint": "字母永遠照同一個順序排，從 A 到 Z。這叫做字母順序，字典裡的字也是照這個順序排的，所以會排字母順序就會查字典。"}
   ],

