  {
   "unit_id": "eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams",
   "title_zh": "母音組合（ai／ay、ee／ea、oa、oo）",
   "can_do": "我能認出常見的母音組合，知道兩個母音排在一起常常發一個音：ai／ay 發 /eɪ/（rain、play）、ee／ea 發 /iː/（see、sea）、oa 發 /oʊ/（boat）、oo 發 /uː/（moon），並讀出這些字。",
   "situation_group": "自然發音：母音組合",
   "subject": "eng",
   "strand": "phonics",
   "est_minutes": 11,
   "knowledge_point_ids": [
    "eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"
   ],
   "prerequisites": ["eng.t_base.phonics.cvc-blending"],
   "reuse_pages": [],

   "claims": [
    {"claim_id": "c-vt-ai-ay", "text": "The vowel teams 'ai' and 'ay' usually spell the sound /eɪ/ (the name of letter A): 'ai' as in rain, train, wait; 'ay' as in play, day, say ('ay' is common at the end of a word).",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "母音組合 ai 與 ay 通常發 /eɪ/（字母 A 的名音）：ai 如 rain／train／wait；ay 如 play／day／say（ay 常出現在字尾）；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-vt-ee-ea", "text": "The vowel teams 'ee' and 'ea' often spell /iː/ (the name of letter E): 'ee' as in see, tree, feet; 'ea' as in sea, eat, read. Note: 'ea' is not always /iː/ -- in words like 'bread' and 'head' it is the short /ɛ/, and in 'great' and 'break' it is /eɪ/ -- so 'ea' must be checked word by word.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "ee 與 ea 常發 /iː/（字母 E 名音）：ee 如 see／tree／feet；ea 如 sea／eat／read；但 ea 不一定發 /iː/——bread／head 發短音 /ɛ/、great／break 發 /eɪ/，故 ea 須逐字確認；誠實標出 ea 多讀音；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-vt-oa", "text": "The vowel team 'oa' usually spells /oʊ/ (the name of letter O): boat, coat, road, soap.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "oa 通常發 /oʊ/（字母 O 名音）：boat／coat／road／soap；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-vt-oo", "text": "The vowel team 'oo' often spells the long /uː/: moon, food, soon, zoo. But 'oo' also spells a shorter /ʊ/ in common words like 'book', 'good', and 'foot', so 'oo' must be checked word by word.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "oo 常發長音 /uː/：moon／food／soon／zoo；但 oo 也發較短的 /ʊ/，如 book／good／foot，故 oo 須逐字確認；誠實標出 oo 兩讀音；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"}
   ],

   "teach": [
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"],
     "body": "Sometimes two vowels sit together and make one sound. We call these vowel teams. Two very common teams spell the name of letter A, /eɪ/: 'ai' as in rain, and 'ay' as in play. You often see 'ay' at the end of a word (day, play, say) and 'ai' in the middle (rain, train).",
     "zh_hint": "有時候兩個母音排在一起，只發一個音，我們叫它「母音組合」。有兩個很常見的組合都發字母 A 的名音 /eɪ/：ai（像 rain）和 ay（像 play）。ay 常出現在字尾（day、play、say），ai 常在字中間（rain、train）。"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"], "audio": "ph_vt_ex1",
     "body": "rain, play. see, sea.",
     "zh_hint": "聽母音組合的音：rain、play 都是 /eɪ/；see、sea 都是 /iː/。"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"],
     "body": "Two more teams, 'ee' and 'ea', often spell the name of letter E, /iː/: see, tree (ee) and sea, eat (ea). The team 'oa' spells the name of letter O, /oʊ/: boat, coat. The team 'oo' often spells a long /uː/: moon, food.",
     "zh_hint": "另外兩個組合 ee 和 ea 常發字母 E 的名音 /iː/：see、tree（ee）和 sea、eat（ea）。組合 oa 發字母 O 的名音 /oʊ/：boat、coat。組合 oo 常發長音 /uː/：moon、food。"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"], "audio": "ph_vt_ex2",
     "body": "boat, moon.",
     "zh_hint": "聽：boat 的 oa 發 /oʊ/；moon 的 oo 發 /uː/。"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.vowel-teams"],
     "body": "Careful: a few teams can make more than one sound. 'ea' is usually /iː/ (sea), but in 'bread' and 'head' it is the short /ɛ/. 'oo' is often /uː/ (moon), but in 'book' and 'good' it is a shorter /ʊ/. When you are not sure, check the word.",
     "zh_hint": "要小心：有些組合不只一種音。ea 通常是 /iː/（sea），但在 bread、head 裡是短音 /ɛ/；oo 常是 /uː/（moon），但在 book、good 裡是較短的 /ʊ/。不確定時就逐字查一下。"}
   ],

   "practice": [
    {"question_id": "P1-vt-ai-ay-sound", "type": "mcq", "validation_method": "expert",
     "stem": "rain 和 play 裡的母音組合 ai、ay 發的是哪一個音？", "answer": "/eɪ/",
