  {
   "unit_id": "eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled",
   "title_zh": "r 控制母音（ar／or／er／ir／ur）",
   "can_do": "我能認出母音後面接 r 時，r 會改變母音的音：ar 發 /ɑr/（car）、or 發 /ɔr/（for）、er／ir／ur 重讀時都發 /ɜr/（her／bird／turn），並讀出這些字。",
   "situation_group": "自然發音：r 控制母音",
   "subject": "eng",
   "strand": "phonics",
   "est_minutes": 11,
   "knowledge_point_ids": [
    "eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"
   ],
   "prerequisites": ["eng.t_base.phonics.cvc-blending"],
   "reuse_pages": [],

   "claims": [
    {"claim_id": "c-rc-concept", "text": "When the letter r comes right after a vowel, it changes the vowel's sound: the vowel is no longer a plain short or long vowel. These are called r-controlled vowels.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "當 r 緊接在母音後面，會改變母音的音，母音不再是單純的短音或長音，稱為 r 控制母音（r-controlled）；phonics 通行概念；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-rc-ar-or", "text": "The team 'ar' usually spells /ɑr/ (car, star, far), and the team 'or' usually spells /ɔr/ (for, corn, fork).",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "組合 ar 通常發 /ɑr/（car／star／far），組合 or 通常發 /ɔr/（for／corn／fork）；採美式／KK；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"},
    {"claim_id": "c-rc-er-ir-ur", "text": "In a stressed syllable, the teams 'er', 'ir', and 'ur' all spell the same sound, /ɜr/: her (er), bird (ir), turn (ur). When the syllable is weak (unstressed), this softens to /ər/, as at the end of 'water'.",
     "kind": "language-usage", "source_refs": ["Cambridge Dictionary"],
     "verification_ref": "在重讀音節裡 er／ir／ur 合流為同一個音 /ɜr/：her（er）／bird（ir）／turn（ur）；誠實標出弱讀（非重讀）時弱化為 /ər/（schwa-r，如 water 字尾），故本單元用重讀例；採美式／KK；Cambridge Dictionary 讀音可查；待英語母語 reviewer 複核", "risk_class": "normal", "status": "provisional"}
   ],

   "teach": [
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"],
     "body": "When the letter r comes right after a vowel, the r changes the vowel's sound. The vowel is no longer a plain short or long vowel; the vowel and the r join into one sound. We call these r-controlled vowels. Hear it in 'car': the a and the r make one sound together.",
     "zh_hint": "當字母 r 緊接在母音後面，r 會改變前面母音的音。母音不再是單純的短音或長音，而是母音和 r 黏在一起變成一個音。這叫做「r 控制母音」。從 car 聽：a 和 r 合成一個音。"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"],
     "body": "Two common r-controlled teams: 'ar' usually says /ɑr/ (car, star, far), with an open mouth; 'or' usually says /ɔr/ (for, corn, fork), with rounder lips. The word tells you the sound.",
     "zh_hint": "兩個常見的 r 控制組合：ar 通常發 /ɑr/（car、star、far），嘴巴張開；or 通常發 /ɔr/（for、corn、fork），嘴唇比較圓。用例字記這個音最準。"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"], "audio": "ph_rc_ex1",
     "body": "car, star, for, corn.",
     "zh_hint": "聽：car、star 的 ar 發 /ɑr/；for、corn 的 or 發 /ɔr/。"},
    {"kind": "text", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"],
     "body": "Here is a helpful surprise: in a stressed syllable, the teams 'er', 'ir', and 'ur' all make the SAME sound, /ɜr/. So the vowel part of her, bird, and turn sounds the same, even though the spelling is different. (In a weak, unstressed syllable this sound softens to /ər/, like the end of 'water'.)",
     "zh_hint": "有個好用的小驚喜：在重讀的音節裡，er、ir、ur 三個組合都發同一個音 /ɜr/。所以 her、bird、turn 中間的母音聽起來一樣，雖然拼法不同。（在輕讀、不重讀的音節裡，這個音會弱化成 /ər/，像 water 的字尾。）"},
    {"kind": "example", "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"], "audio": "ph_rc_ex2",
     "body": "her, bird, turn.",
     "zh_hint": "聽：her（er）、bird（ir）、turn（ur）中間重讀都發同一個 /ɜr/。"}
   ],

   "practice": [
    {"question_id": "P1-rc-ar", "type": "mcq", "validation_method": "expert",
     "stem": "car 裡的母音組合 ar 發哪個音？", "answer": "/ɑr/",
     "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"], "required_kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.r-controlled"],
     "options": ["/ɑr/", "/ɔr/", "/ɜr/", "/æ/"],
     "distractor_rationales": {
      "/ɔr/": "/ɔr/ 是 or 的音（for），不是 ar。",
      "/ɜr/": "/ɜr/ 是 er／ir／ur 的音（her），不是 ar。",
      "/æ/": "/æ/ 是短母音 a（map），但 car 的 a 後面有 r，會變成 /ɑr/。"},
     "answer_evidence": ["c-rc-ar-or"],
     "feedback": "ar 通常發 /ɑr/，如 car、star。"},

