     "feedback": "bus 結尾是嘶擦音 /s/，-es 要加一整個音節 /ɪz/（buses＝/ˈbʌsɪz/）。"},

    {"question_id": "P5-ed-dictation", "type": "dictation", "validation_method": "expert",
     "stem": "聽音檔，把你聽到的字寫下來（這是一個規則過去式）。", "answer": "played",
     "audio": "ph_ed_dict01",
     "kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.ed-sound"], "required_kp_ids": ["eng.t_base.phonics.ed-sound"],
